Package: mtuspy
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tobias Oetiker <tobi@oetiker.ch>
Recommends: libcap2-bin
Description: Path MTU discovery tool using native ICMP with Don't Fragment bit
 Discovers the Path MTU to a network host. It sends ICMP echo requests with the
 Don't Fragment bit set and finds the largest packet that gets through with a
 binary search. A single static binary.
